mbers from the tiny sample", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "2. Real current numbers from the tiny sample", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "mean-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 55, "y": 625, "width": 410, "height": 290, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 15020, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1474833590, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085050, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aJ", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "qfUbir3j", "type": "text", "x": 73, "y": 643, "width": 253.8720703125, "height": 168.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 15021, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 461808042, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085050, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aK", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Input tensor values\n\nMeaning:\nthe image is now numbers.\nMean is average brightness.\n\nshape = (3, 3, 3)\nvalues = 27 normalized RGB numbers\nmean_value = 0.4977", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Input tensor values\n\nMeaning:\nthe image is now numbers.\nMean is average brightness.\n\nshape = (3, 3, 3)\nvalues = 27 normalized RGB numbers\nmean_value = 0.4977", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "VfvWAYAQ", "type": "rectangle", "x": 455, "y": 625, "width": 410, "height": 290, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 15022, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1055729142, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085050, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aL", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "fnY8fXk1", "type": "text", "x": 473, "y": 643, "width": 259.28466796875, "height": 206.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 15023, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1314446442, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085050, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aM", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Fake forward formula\n\nMeaning:\nplaceholder math creates class scores.\nA real CNN will replace this.\n\nlogit0 = 0.10 + mean * 0.20\nlogit1 = 0.15 + mean * 0.15\nlogit2 = 0.05 + shape_value\nlogit3 = 0.08 + (1-mean) * 0.10\nshape_value = 0.09", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Fake forward formula\n\nMeaning:\nplaceholder math creates class scores.\nA real CNN will replace this.\n\nlogit0 = 0.10 + mean * 0.20\nlogit1 = 0.15 + mean * 0.15\nlogit2 = 0.05 + shape_value\nlogit3 = 0.08 + (1-mean) * 0.10\nshape_value = 0.09", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "gbhLp3Pc", "type": "rectangle", "x": 955, "y": 625, "width": 410, "height": 290, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 15024, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 92337974, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085051, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aN", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "hX7UyqP8", "type": "text", "x": 973, "y": 643, "width": 270.65185546875, "height": 206.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 15025, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1217773354, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085051, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aO", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Softmax result\n\nMeaning:\nraw logits become class probabilities.\nThe model currently favors spiral slightly.\n\nlogits:\n[0.1995, 0.2247, 0.1400, 0.1302]\nprobabilities:\n[0.2564, 0.2629, 0.2415, 0.2392]\nadd to ~1.0", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Softmax result\n\nMeaning:\nraw logits become class probabilities.\nThe model currently favors spiral slightly.\n\nlogits:\n[0.1995, 0.2247, 0.1400, 0.1302]\nprobabilities:\n[0.2564, 0.2629, 0.2415, 0.2392]\nadd to ~1.0", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "cSROVK0g", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1455, "y": 625, "width": 410, "height": 290, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 15026, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 67674230, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085051, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aP", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "qLggZRKa", "type": "text", "x": 1495.080223081372, "y": 688.4071127937113, "width": 238.43994140625, "height": 168.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 15027, "version": 80, "versionNonce": 2008953830, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785512472024, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aQ", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Loss result\n\nMeaning:\nchecks probability for the true class.\nHere true class is spiral at index 1.\n\nprobability at index 1 = 0.2629\nloss = -log(0.2629)\nloss = 1.3360", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Loss result\n\nMeaning:\nchecks probability for the true class.\nHere true class is spiral at index 1.\n\nprobability at index 1 = 0.2629\nloss = -log(0.2629)\nloss = 1.3360", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "nums-arrow-1", "type": "arrow", "x": 870, "y": 755, "width": 80, "height": 0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 15028, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1044980150, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085051, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aR", "hasTextLink": false, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "points": [[0, 0], [80, 0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"id": "nums-arrow-2", "type": "arrow", "x": 1370, "y": 755, "width": 80, "height": 0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 15029, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 2140896426, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085051, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aS", "hasTextLink": false, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "points": [[0, 0], [80, 0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"id": "nums-arrow-0", "type": "arrow", "x": 470, "y": 755, "width": 90, "height": 0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 15030, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 2003270390, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085051, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aT", "hasTextLink": false, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "points": [[0, 0], [-90, 0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"id": "VMF5b0Ac", "type": "text", "x": 41.45401016315162, "y": 1058.724810826495, "width": 369.46875, "height": 30, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5f3dc4", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 15031, "version": 49, "versionNonce": 892390698, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485511006, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aU", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "3. What is real vs what is mocked?", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "3. What is real vs what is mocked?", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "real-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 36.69529671686303, "y": 1109.8059375431299, "width": 520, "height": 275, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 15032, "version": 57, "versionNonce": 1943615478, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485502964, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aV", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "sjlSDRI3", "type": "text", "x": 82.8951316417207, "y": 1111.7764813021704, "width": 253.4140625, "height": 200, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 15033, "version": 63, "versionNonce": 596009782, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485501001, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aW", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Real in current code\n\n- loads validated manifest\n- loads current dataset splits\n- uses GalaxyTrainingSample\n- loops over epochs\n- calls a model-like forward()\n- calculates softmax probabilities\n- calculates cross-entropy-style loss\n- returns a training summary", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Real in current code\n\n- loads validated manifest\n- loads current dataset splits\n- uses GalaxyTrainingSample\n- loops over epochs\n- calls a model-like forward()\n- calculates softmax probabilities\n- calculates cross-entropy-style loss\n- returns a training summary", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "mock-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 604.7773645465542, "y": 1114.48823989037, "width": 520, "height": 275, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 15034, "version": 46, "versionNonce": 1600613302, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485505652, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aX", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "OJJLlW4i", "type": "text", "x": 690.2652395654361, "y": 1130.866520881082, "width": 226.734375, "height": 200, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 15035, "version": 57, "versionNonce": 1700422838, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485504625, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aY", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Mocked / placeholder\n\n- no real CNN layers\n- no PyTorch tensor yet\n- no learned weights\n- no backpropagation\n- no optimizer.step()\n- no checkpoint\n- no real accuracy\n- fake logits from simple formula", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Mocked / placeholder\n\n- no real CNN layers\n- no PyTorch tensor yet\n- no learned weights\n- no backpropagation\n- no optimizer.step()\n- no checkpoint\n- no real accuracy\n- fake logits from simple formula", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "why-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1164.942393502625, "y": 1127.1852175155702, "width": 600, "height": 275, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 15036, "version": 60, "versionNonce": 326884406, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485507323, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aZ", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "why-text", "type": "text", "x": 1212.869968278187, "y": 1197.4120980300743, "width": 1077.0625, "height": 140, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 15037, "version": 55, "versionNonce": 1007145962, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485508708, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aa", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Why prepare fake pieces?\n\nBecause we want to prove the software path first.\n\nIf the data path, label mapping, epoch loop, and loss shape work before PyTorch, then when PyTorch enters we know where to look if something breaks.\n\nThis reduces confusion.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Why prepare fake pieces?\n\nBecause we want to prove the software path first.\n\nIf the data path, label mapping, epoch loop, and loss shape work before PyTorch, then when PyTorch enters we know where to look if something breaks.\n\nThis reduces confusion.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "UyiwjFg2", "type": "text", "x": 55, "y": 1435, "width": 561.64453125, "height": 30, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5f3dc4", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 15038, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 428822518, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085051, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "ab", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "4. Epochs and training steps in the current command", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "4. Epochs and training steps in the current command", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "epoch-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 55, "y": 1495, "width": 800, "height": 260, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f3f0ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 15039, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 96883306, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085051, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "ac", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "epqCzo5b", "type": "text", "x": 80, "y": 1520, "width": 359.3046875, "height": 240, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 15040, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1582162230, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085051, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "ad", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Command:\n\nscripts/train_galaxy_cnn_baseline.py ... --epochs 2\n\nCurrent data:\ntrain samples = 1\n\nMeaning:\nepoch 1 visits gz2-000001 once\nepoch 2 visits gz2-000001 once\n\ntraining steps = 1 sample * 2 epochs = 2", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Command:\n\nscripts/train_galaxy_cnn_baseline.py ... --epochs 2\n\nCurrent data:\ntrain samples = 1\n\nMeaning:\nepoch 1 visits gz2-000001 once\nepoch 2 visits gz2-000001 once\n\ntraining steps = 1 sample * 2 epochs = 2", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "loop-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 970, "y": 1495, "width": 740, "height": 260, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 15041, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1592030506, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085051, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "ae", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "agxFQ7ak", "type": "text", "x": 995, "y": 1520, "width": 504.0234375, "height": 140, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 15042, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1202211446, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085051, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "af", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Code shape in run_training_loop()\n\nfor _epoch in range(epochs):\n    for sample in train_samples:\n        run_placeholder_training_step(sample, active_model)\n\nValidation/test samples are loaded, but the loop does not train on them.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Code shape in run_training_loop()\n\nfor _epoch in range(epochs):\n    for sample in train_samples:\n        run_placeholder_training_step(sample, active_model)\n\nValidation/test samples are loaded, but the loop does not train on them.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "N9MPAwxT", "type": "text", "x": 55, "y": 1845, "width": 416.16796875, "height": 30, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5f3dc4", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 15043, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 498089962, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085051, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "ag", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "5. How this becomes real PyTorch later", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "5. How this becomes real PyTorch later", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "today-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 55, "y": 1905, "width": 520, "height": 245, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 15044, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 73632694, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085051, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "ah", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "ctmdqq68", "type": "text", "x": 80, "y": 1930, "width": 297.9296875, "height": 240, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 15045, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 238334634, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085051, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "ai", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Today\n\nPlaceholderGalaxyModel.forward(sample)\n  -> fake logits\n\nsoftmax(logits)\n  -> probabilities\n\ncross_entropy_loss(probabilities, label_id)\n  -> placeholder loss\n\nNo weights updated.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Today\n\nPlaceholderGalaxyModel.forward(sample)\n  -> fake logits\n\nsoftmax(logits)\n  -> probabilities\n\ncross_entropy_loss(probabilities, label_id)\n  -> placeholder loss\n\nNo weights updated.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "tomorrow-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 700, "y": 1905, "width": 620, "height": 245, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 15046, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 581215478, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085051, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aj", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "aGZ859m2", "type": "text", "x": 725, "y": 1930, "width": 305.03125, "height": 220, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 15047, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1125961066, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085051, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "ak", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Next ML direction\n\nTinyGalaxyCNN.forward(torch_tensor)\n  -> real CNN logits\n\ntorch.nn.CrossEntropyLoss(logits, label_id)\n  -> real loss\n\nLater milestone:\nloss.backward() + optimizer.step()\n  -> weights update", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Next ML direction\n\nTinyGalaxyCNN.forward(torch_tensor)\n  -> real CNN logits\n\ntorch.nn.CrossEntropyLoss(logits, label_id)\n  -> real loss\n\nLater milestone:\nloss.backward() + optimizer.step()\n  -> weights update", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "future-arrow", "type": "arrow", "x": 590, "y": 2025, "width": 100, "height": 0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 15048, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 602969654, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085051, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "al", "hasTextLink": false, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "points": [[0, 0], [100, 0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"id": "concept-links-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1435, "y": 1905, "width": 430, "height": 245, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 15049, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1102286890, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1785485085051, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "am", "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "ZxeEfYF3", "type": "text", "x": 1480.0173324562993, "y": 19